-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 9~20261109 (2026-11-09)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Every wallpaper package of this package (SparkyOSOxygen and the eighteen stereo wallpapers) carries, beside its 3840x2160 picture,
    the sizes Plasma's Image wallpaper chooses from: 1280x720, 1366x768, 1600x900, 1920x1080 and 2560x1440, each a Lanczos
    downscale of that same picture made at build time (wallpaper-sizes.py), never an upscale; plasmashell spent a third of its start
    decoding the 4 MB 3840x2160 PNG on a 1080p screen (ORDER 456, from ORDER 409's profile). The 3840x2160 pictures, the stereo pairs
    and /opt/artwork are unchanged

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 9~20261102 (2026-11-02)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Copy only tracked artwork and recipe inputs into source and binary packages.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 9~20261016.1 (2026-10-16)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * GRUB's background is the SparkyOS one (/etc/default/grub.d/20-sparkyos-artwork.cfg sets GRUB_BACKGROUND, which
    Sparky's and Debian's theme scripts use first); a background the person chose in /etc/default/grub or put
    into /boot/grub is kept

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 9~20261016 (2026-10-16)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * First package of the SparkyOS artwork of release 9 (artwork repository 9~20261008.1): the Oxygen wallpaper, the GRUB background, the swirl pixmaps and the eighteen stereo wallpapers, installed as its install.sh does
  * The Oxygen wallpaper also as the Plasma wallpaper package SparkyOSOxygen, the default wallpaper of the Sparky Stereo Oxygen Plasma style
